## Adapted content

Lessons whose front matter declares a `source:` value other than `original`
(e.g. `rpi-pico-2e`) are derivative works of the source listed under that id
in `_data/sources.yml`, and are licensed under **that source's own licence**,
not the licence above.

The Raspberry Pi Pico MicroPython material is CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 Unported. Its
ShareAlike term requires derivatives to remain under a compatible licence,
and 3.0 Unported is not one-way compatible with 4.0 — so these pages stay at
CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 Unported and cannot be relicensed to 4.0 by virtue of this
file.

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/
